        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-07T02:41:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Discussed offline: OUTPUT_INACTIVE still sets it as an output, but requests the initial value be set according to the polarity (active-low/active-high). There\u0027s a block in z_impl_gpio_pin_configure that inverts the initial value based on polarity, but only if OUTPUT_INIT_LOGICAL is also requested (which it is for OUTPUT_INACTIVE).\n\nWe should prefer to use ACTIVE/INACTIVE in general, since that will honor the polarity setting of a pin whereas LOW/HIGH does not.",
      "parentUuid": "e0f45397_4975fae4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
        "startChar": 35,
